      "side": 1,
      "message": "os_deployment_resource stores a full host+path URL here, but find_virtual_media_resource stores just the bare path (line 1160). Both work today because each call site pairs the value with host_uri, but the two fields mean different things to whoever wires the next action, so it is easy to double-prefix or omit the host. Storing both the same way (both relative, or both full) would keep them interchangeable.",
